---
import readmeSource from '../../README.md?raw';
import designSource from '../../DESIGN.md?raw';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import NavBar from '../components/NavBar.astro';
import { PORTFOLIO_SOURCE } from '../config/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { renderRepositoryDocument } from '../lib/repository-documents';

const [readmeHtml, designHtml] = await Promise.all([
  renderRepositoryDocument(readmeSource, 'readme', PORTFOLIO_SOURCE.repository),
  renderRepositoryDocument(designSource, 'design', PORTFOLIO_SOURCE.repository),
]);

const readmeUrl = `${PORTFOLIO_SOURCE.repository}/blob/main/README.md`;
const designUrl = `${PORTFOLIO_SOURCE.repository}/blob/main/DESIGN.md`;
const figmaEmbedUrl = new URL(
  PORTFOLIO_SOURCE.figma.replace('www.figma.com', 'embed.figma.com'),
);
figmaEmbedUrl.searchParams.set('node-id', '114-15');
figmaEmbedUrl.searchParams.set('embed-host', 'max-pinkert-portfolio');
---

<BaseLayout title="How I built this">
  <main id="main" class="container bts">
    <header class="bts__hero">
      <h1>How I <br />built this</h1>
      <p>
        Welcome to the meta case study of how I built this website. For this
        project I can actually just share the raw data. Browse through my Figma
        file and GitHub repo, I tried to include explanations and information,
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="bts__cards">
      <section class="bts-card bts-card--design" aria-labelledby="h-design">
        <h2 id="h-design">Design</h2>
        <Button type="secondary" href={PORTFOLIO_SOURCE.figma}
          >Figma file →</Button
        >
        <p>
          My one and only Figma. Since starting my rookie journey as a
          about-to-be designer, Figma has always been my place to play around,
          no matter which use case. Affinity also started playing a role a bit,
          especially when it comes to print design. But Figma is my home turf
          and I enjoy working in it. Here the file where all the website came to
          life. I tried to keep a bit more artifacts than usually, take a look:
        </p>
        <iframe
          class="bts-card__embed"
          src={figmaEmbedUrl.href}
          title="Portfolio Figma file — Organisms"
          loading="lazy"
          allowfullscreen
          tabindex="0"></iframe>
      </section>

      <section class="bts-card bts-card--code" aria-labelledby="h-code">
        <h2 id="h-code">Code</h2>
        <Button type="secondary" href={PORTFOLIO_SOURCE.repository}
          >GitHub repository →</Button
        >
        <p>
          This isn’t the first try at coding a website, my journey started with
          a blog in Jimdo, evolved to Webflow where we build the website for
          2zero and ultimately went back to pure HTML/CSS. I still have to rely
          on coding agents to do the heavy lifting but I at least can understand
          the generated code and structure which helps to question the output of
          LLMs and also to do changes on my own. Take a look:
        </p>

        <div class="bts-doc">
          <section
            class="bts-doc__body"
            aria-labelledby="bts-readme-label"
            tabindex="0"
            set:html={readmeHtml}
          />
          <p class="bts-doc__label" id="bts-readme-label">
            <a href={readmeUrl}>/README.md</a>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bts-doc">
          <section
            class="bts-doc__body"
            aria-labelledby="bts-design-label"
            tabindex="0"
            set:html={designHtml}
          />
          <p class="bts-doc__label" id="bts-design-label">
            <a href={designUrl}>/DESIGN.md</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="bts__credits" aria-labelledby="h-credits">
      <h2 id="h-credits">Credits</h2>
      <p>
        I enjoy trying out different tools and playing around with them. And
        also as part of this portfolio website I took to several helpers and
        here is a small way to say thank you and at least credit your work so
        hopefully people read this and try them out themselves:
      </p>
      <ul class="bts-credits__list">
        <li>
          <span
            ><a href="https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/erode">Erode</a>, Typeface
            by Indian Type Foundry, via Fontshare</span
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <span
            ><a href="https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/satoshi">Satoshi</a>,
            Typeface by Indian Type Foundry, via Fontshare</span
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <span
            ><a href="https://oklch.com">OKLCH</a>, Color picker by Evil
            Martians</span
          >
        </li>
        <li><span>Bauhaus, Figma Weave</span></li>
        <li>
          <span><a href="https://brandfetch.com/">Brandfetch</a>, Figma</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span
            >Rename Layers, Figma, I love structure, but renaming layers just
            takes too much time.</span
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>

  <NavBar mode="dark" label="Site" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .bts {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .bts p,
  .bts-credits__list {
    color: var(--color-neutral-800);
  }

  .bts__hero,
  .bts__credits {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: calc(6 * var(--grid-column) + 5 * var(--grid-gutter));
  }

  .bts__hero {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .bts__cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .bts-card {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: start;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
  }

  .bts-card--design {
    background-color: var(--color-tomato-100);
  }

  .bts-card--code {
    background-color: var(--color-herbs-100);
  }

  .bts h2 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
  }

  .bts-card__embed {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    border: 0;
  }

  .bts-doc {
    display: grid;
    width: 100%;
    gap: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .bts-doc__body {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 0;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    padding: var(--space-sm);
    overflow: auto;
    background-color: var(--color-neutral-100);
    scrollbar-color: var(--color-lemon-100) transparent;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
  }

  .bts-doc__body::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: var(--space-3xs);
  }

  .bts-doc__body::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    margin-block: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .bts-doc__body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    min-height: var(--space-lg);
    background-color: var(--color-lemon-100);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(h3) {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(h4) {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(h5) {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(p),
  .bts-doc__body :global(ul),
  .bts-doc__body :global(ol) {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(ul),
  .bts-doc__body :global(ol) {
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(li + li) {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(strong) {
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(a) {
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-neutral-300);
  }

  .bts-doc__label a:hover,
  .bts-doc__body :global(a:hover),
  .bts-credits__list a:hover {
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(.table-wrap) {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(table) {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(th),
  .bts-doc__body :global(td) {
    padding: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-sm);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-neutral-200);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(th) {
    color: var(--color-neutral-700);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(code),
  .bts-doc__body :global(pre) {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    line-height: var(--line-height-loose);
    letter-spacing: var(--letter-spacing-extra-wide);
  }

  .bts-doc__body :global(pre) {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .bts__credits {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .bts-credits__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .bts-credits__list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--space-sm) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .bts-credits__list li::before {
    width: var(--space-sm);
    height: var(--space-sm);
    margin-block-start: calc((1lh - var(--space-sm)) / 2);
    content: '';
    background-color: var(--color-pickled-500);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .bts__hero {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      align-items: end;
    }

    .bts__cards {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
